      "rationale": "Local round-1 true-versus-rotated grouping improved auxiliary discrimination while losing click. Pinned INFNet forward explicitly uses task-specific masked hubs, motivating a task-access contrast rather than another shared grouping. Declared use in the preceding round did not establish an INFNet effect.",
